<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>object of care, beloved object,
				darling</i>, of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὦμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				972
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				214
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέαισιν παρθένοισι μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					10.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαρίτων μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριδος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				217
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ φίλτατον μ. δώμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					235
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ γραῦ, τῷ θανάτῳ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					905
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>charge, duty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1551
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλον πάλαι μ. μοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					150
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>care, anxiety</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				444
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				14.2
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
